<title>JAPAN: Akai Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Akai Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 24.13</p>
<p> Operating   loss 158    million</p>
<p> Current	    418    million</p>
<p> Net		  385    million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.88 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    230 million</p>
<p> Interim div		  --</p>
<p>NOTE - Akai Electric Co Ltd is a maker of audio equipment</p>
<p>and video tape recorders. No comparison data is available</p>
<p>bacause the company has changed its business term.</p>
</text>
